  "limits": [
    "Measurement-only on exact52;54 is parked. Observer frame rates do not establish a speedup.",
    "One-in16 eligible attempts sampled independently for world, inventory and inventory_paused; aggregate raw counts and ticks before division; unused means null.",
    "Existing coarse recipe preparation/finalization methods are enveloped; all original callers are UpdateRecipeList. Original callsites and access remain unchanged; no per-recipe condition clocks, cache, reordered predicate or skipped work.",
    "Inclusive scopes overlap. Exclusive subtracts measured direct children but still includes observer and unmeasured work. Recipe exclusive is not isolated filter/material/pure-scan CPU time.",
    "Original Main.Draw boundary snapshots cannot prove intermediate toggle-and-return, effective render camera/zoom or arbitrary capture modes.",
    "Player is raw Main.player[myPlayer]; camera Main.screenPosition; zoom GameZoomTarget; UI scale read-only get_UIScale; hover/mouse/guide item types are raw fields, null encoded-1. Available recipes is raw Main.numAvailableRecipes, not number of scanned recipes.",
    "Scene ranges include every eligible cohort boundary, not just selected samples. Guide type and available-recipe ranges are recorded, not treated as stability exclusions.",
    "world excludes paused; inventory and inventory_paused separate. Menu/map/dead/ghost/spectator/invalid frames do not donate cost samples.",
    "All existing calls, predicate order, returns, exceptions and side effects remain authoritative. Observer failure is sticky, cannot suppress original work and cannot donate partial timing.",
    "Snapshot and clock-pair costs are reported indicators, not automatic deductions. Report body timing excludes footer cost; post-END failure follows the existing protected cooldown pattern.",
    "Any measurement_invalid flag blocks performance interpretation. Malformed, mismatched, reordered, incomplete or inconsistent packets are rejected rather than repaired."
  ],
  "methodology": {
    "helper": "Terraria.NXRecipeProfile55",
    "base_build": 52,
    "coarse_recipe_only": true,
    "frame_sample_denominator": 16,
    "metric_ids": {
      "frame_draw": 0,
      "ui": 1,
      "inventory": 2,
